{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>PDF 文件處理總是讓您感到頭痛嗎？《PDF Print》這款強大的工具 App 今天限時免費中，它能徹底改變您與 PDF 文件互動的方式。無論您是學生、老師，還是專業人士，都能利用它輕鬆組織、註釋及設計文件，同時有效節省紙張，解決日常文件管理與排版上的種種困擾。</p>\n\n<h2>豐富範本與環保排版</h2>\n<p>《PDF Print》內建豐富的範本庫，從數學練習紙、每日規劃到習慣追蹤器，各式專業頁面都能即時生成。其獨特的 N-Up 排版功能，能將多頁 PDF 文件聰明地排列到單張紙上列印，大幅節省紙張消耗。此外，您還能輕鬆合併多個 PDF 檔案，並透過篩選器精確管理頁面，讓文件保持井然有序，提升您的工作效率。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-74-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-75-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-76-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-77-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-78-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-79-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PDF Print – Templates</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T19:59:38.292064+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}